tle_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1520443015:0":{"text":"아이들에게 알려줘야 할까요?","source_cn":"要告诉他们吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1DB6A85EB2953B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520443016:0":{"text":"......","source_cn":"……<key:dialog125>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3CD1618505FEC4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1520443017:0":{"text":"모르간, 어떻게 생각하나요?","source_cn":"摩根，你怎么看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEA22F10DDA6A035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1520443018:0":{"text":"나? 난 아무것도 안 하는 게 좋을 것 같은데.","source_cn":"我？要我说，就什么都不要做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57EC98A7D4E99FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1520443019:0":{"text":"톨로가 부모님과 작별을 마치면, 영지로 데려다 준 뒤에 우린 집으로 돌아가면 돼.","source_cn":"等托洛和他父母说完话，我们把他送回营地，就可以收拾收拾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB53650F5F76DA10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1520443020:1":{"text":"...그게 끝인가요?","source_cn":"……就这样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7955028A654E996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1520443021:0":{"text":"응, 그게 끝이지.","source_cn":"就这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F554137854CCE19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1520443022:0":{"text":"애들한테 굳이 진실을 알려줄 필요도 없고, 먹고 살 문제를 고민해 줄 필요도 없어.","source_cn":"没必要把真相告诉那些孩子，也没必要去考虑他们的吃喝问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7D02FE87DE0961","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1520443022":{"text":"애들한테 굳이 진실을 알려줄 필요도 없고, 먹고 살 문제를 고민해 줄 필요도 없어.","source_cn":"没必要把真相告诉那些孩子，也没必要去考虑他们的吃喝问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7D02FE87DE0961","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1520443024:0":{"text":"모르간, 이건 목숨이 걸린 문제예요. 나중에 다시 진지하게 이야기해 봐요.","source_cn":"摩根，事关人命，关于这两个问题，我们再好好讨论一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DF783E13470C65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1520443025:0":{"text":"그래서, 애들한테 진실을 알려야한다고 생각하는 거야?","source_cn":"所以，你们觉得应该把真相告诉那群孩子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x843A1629C72E0C1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:29:1520443025":{"text":"그래서, 애들한테 진실을 알려야한다고 생각하는 거야?","source_cn":"所以，你们觉得应该把真相告诉那群孩子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x843A1629C72E0C1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1520443026:0":{"text":"쟤들은 어리지만 바보는 아니야. 영지를 나가야 할 때가 오면 자연스럽게 무덤을 발견하게 되겠지.","source_cn":"那群孩子只是小，不是笨。等到他们不得不走出营地时，自然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD80755314EBEB667","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1520443027:0":{"text":"굳이 우리가 말하지 않아도 진실을 알게 되어 있어. 그 시기를 괜히 앞당길 필요 없잖아?","source_cn":"即使不告诉他们，他们也会得知真相。又何必多此一举呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB1B721A4C3BCD2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1520443028:0":{"text":"하지만 어른들은 돌아오지 않아요. 거짓말을 이어가면서 아이들에게 헛된 희망을 품게 하는 게 정말 괜찮은 걸까요?","source_cn":"但那些大人们不会再回来了，维持谎言，让那些孩子们继续怀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A8FEC7657E9F250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1520443029:0":{"text":"어떤 방식이든 아이들이 진실을 알게 된다면 반드시 상처로 남게 될 거야.","source_cn":"无论那些孩子以什么方式知道真相，都必然会留下创伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCADBDAB09F3C8479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1520443030:1":{"text":"어두운 과거를 겪은 사람은, 그 상처를 치유하기 위해 평생을 바쳐야 해. 그건 아이들이 짊어져야 할 운명이야.","source_cn":"经历过黑暗的凡人，需要穷尽一生，来尝试治愈过去的创伤。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5632F4E29A412073","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1520443031:1":{"text":"애들은 아직 너무 어려. 이 잔혹한 진실은 그 애들의 세계를 짓눌러버릴지도 몰라.","source_cn":"他们太小，这个真相太过沉重，会把他们尚且幼稚的世界压垮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x650CDCD707571CA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1520443032:1":{"text":"스스로 진실을 깨달을 수 있을 만큼 성장했을 때야말로, 진실을 받아들일 준비가 되었다는 뜻이기도 하지.","source_cn":"等他们成长到能够自己发现真相时，才能做好接受它的准备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5CC4DCDD6FAFCA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1520443033:1":{"text":"그전까지 우리가 나설 필요는 없어. 적어도 나에게 그럴 여력은 없다고!","source_cn":"在那之前，没必要越俎代庖——至少我没那个心力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97296B5DB4D75C54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:39:1520443033":{"text":"그전까지 우리가 나설 필요는 없어. 적어도 나에게 그럴 여력은 없다고!","source_cn":"在那之前，没必要越俎代庖——至少我没那个心力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97296B5DB4D75C54","variant_status":"","ma